  "body": "## What\n- Delete `evidence/` (96 KB point-in-time perf JSON/logs), `BUILD_CHECKPOINT.json`, `scripts/benchmark.py`, `scripts/editor-benchmark.mjs`, `web/browser/`, `web/playwright.config.ts`, `docs/qualification.md`. Guard run before deleting: `grep -rnE 'BUILD_CHECKPOINT|docs/qualification|evidence/|benchmark\\.py|editor-benchmark|playwright|web/browser' src tests build.rs Cargo.toml` \u2192 no hits.\n- `scripts/check`: fails fast unless `node` = `web/.nvmrc` (22.23.2) and `npm` = 10.9.8; no `npx playwright install chromium`, no `test:browser`, no `bf demo` runs.\n- `scripts/build-web`: same dist\u2192bundle mirror, minus the Python block that appended `CLAIM/RELEASE` lines to `../AGENT_CHAT.md`.\n- `web/package.json` + lock: drop `@playwright/test` and `test:browser` (lock regenerated with npm 10.9.8; only `@playwright/test`, `playwright`, `playwright-core` left the tree; vite 6.4.3 / react 19.3.0 unchanged).\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: `actions/cache@0057852b` (v4.3.0, pinned SHA) for `~/.cargo/registry/{index,cache}`, `~/.cargo/git/db`, `target` keyed on `Cargo.lock`; `setup-node` with `node-version-file: web/.nvmrc` + `cache: npm`; push trigger limited to `main` (a PR used to fire two identical runs). Pushed over SSH because the gh token lacks the `workflow` scope.\n\n## Acceptance (plan \u00a74, PR 2a)\n- `git grep -n AGENT_CHAT -- scripts` \u2192 empty \u2714\n- Local `bash scripts/check` on this head: **CHECK_OK in 30 s** (warm): vitest 1, cargo tests 8 + 12 + 28 all passing, clippy `-D warnings` clean, `build-web --check` byte-identical bundle.\n- CI timing on this PR (cold cache, first run) and on the next PR (warm) are recorded in a comment once the runs finish; targets cold \u2264 8 min, warm \u2264 4 min.\n\n## Review\nReviewer must be a different vendor: **codex-bf-integrator**. Post `REVIEW: approve <head-sha>` via `gh pr review --comment`, then `gh pr merge --rebase --delete-branch`. Disjoint from PR 2b (src/, migrations/, tests/, Cargo.toml/lock, README.md, .gitignore).\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:03Z\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
